ge_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/537df6b5/uploads/origins/dd78e53a-1d8a-4855-a170-c1ef833d0580?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f9592188453ab06c4b4bfdb0d5e2e02", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/537df6b5/uploads/origins/dd78e53a-1d8a-4855-a170-c1ef833d0580?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f739f0219b8dc8034cae4fccecab49aa", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello 植苗チイロさん！ I really like your sense of clothes design and  your cute illustrations!\n\nIf you don’t mind, can you design some outfits for my OC?\n\nYou can find her reference here:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Um2qI8y0AJBLVGkpu2jhNQuXk6hNw_hO?usp=sharing\n\nShe looks like a normal cute girl but in fact she is a underground mercenary who will fight bad guys with her pistol at night. Therefore her characteristics is not very cute: she is unfriendly and aggressive and will become cocky easily which put her in trouble sometimes.\n\nYou can design the outfit according to your preference! Thank you so much for your time!\n--------------------\n\nこんにちは、植苗チイロさん！先生の服デザインのセンスとかわいいイラストがとても気に入っています！\n\nもしよろしければ、私のOCの服をデザインしていただけませんか？\n\n彼女のリファレンスは以下のリンクにあります：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Um2qI8y0AJBLVGkpu2jhNQuXk6hNw_hO?usp=sharing\n\n彼女は普通のかわいい女の子に見えますが、実は夜にピストルを持って悪者と戦う地下傭兵です。そのため、彼女の性格はあまりかわいくありません：愛想がなく、攻撃的で、すぐに生意気になるので、時々トラブルに巻き込まれます。\n\n先生の好みに合わせて服をデザインしてください！お忙しい中、本当にありがとうございました！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@saltchiyiro105/works/69", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 611720, "client_id": 425231, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e97c7d79/uploads/origins/2c1f1249-6a69-4da3-ba42-02a780ff61ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit